          {
            "id": 596621,
            "name": "",
            "username": "eDaddi",
            "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/e/d07c76/{size}.png",
            "created_at": "2026-10-08T03:47:38.887Z",
            "cooked": "<p><strong>Looking for a TAM or CSM role (remote, St. Louis based)</strong></p>\n<p>I’m looking for a Technical Account Manager or Customer Success Manager role at a company building with automation, integrations or dev tools. I came up as a dev, spent the last several years owning customer accounts, and I run my own business on n8n every day.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>26+ production n8n workflows, some 30 nodes deep, running moderation, social posting, affiliate monetization, ad floor pricing, Magento product, pricing and stock sync, and podcast transcription</li>\n<li>Most workflows have AI steps and together they do the work of a full-time ops hire</li>\n<li>CSM at Gigster: owned 14 accounts and grew my book from $3.7M as sold to $13.9M with F500 and DoW clients.</li>\n<li>12 years as a full-stack developer (PHP, JavaScript, MySQL, APIs, webhooks) and 5 years as a director of development before moving to the customer side</li>\n<li>Ran my own custom software and ecommerce practice for 7 years, with anchor clients on retainer for six-plus years</li>\n<li>Founded Irate4x4, an off-road community serving 7M+ page views a month, profitable since year one</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Interviewed at n8n 2x … but the still don’t hire in Missouri … so … you know if you n8n mods could help Hq fix that LOL</p>",
            "post_number": 1,
            "post_type": 1,
            "posts_count": 2,
